  "description": "<p>You are enveloped by a shroud of void-aspected aether, making it much more difficult to use magic.</p><p>You increase the <strong>Complexity</strong> of any casting checks you make by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, the <strong>Complexity</strong> of any checks made to counteract your spells decrease by <strong>-1</strong> to a minimum of <strong>1</strong>.</p><p>Magical creatures take damage equal to the complexity modifier at the start of their turn.</p>",
